OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%,.** %-,(,%,. (,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AAsia made a big AI bet on Nvidia. What 
OL,4,Ahappens now?                           
OL,6,FTech-heavy stock indexes in Japan,     
OL,7,FSouth Korea and Taiwan went on a       
OL,8,Frollercoaster ride this week. Markets  
OL,9,Fsoared after a near-trillion dollar    
OL,10,Fsurge in Nvidia's share price but then 
OL,11,Fslumped as concerns about political and
OL,12,Fregulatory scrutiny hit investor       
OL,13,Fconfidence.                            
OL,15,FThe chipmaker is a "symbolic           
OL,16,Fbellwether" of the AI trade that is    
OL,17,Ffast becoming key to places like South 
OL,18,FKorea, Taiwan, Singapore and Malaysia,"
OL,19,Fsays Dylan Loh, an international       
OL,20,Fstudies lecturer at Nanyang            
OL,21,FTechnological University.              
